  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Zinc SPF</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ allure 2021 Best of Beauty Award Winner</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A noncomedogenic, dewy tinted moisturizer for all skin types with 15 percent mineral zinc, SPF 35, hyaluronic acid, and light coverage.<br><br><b>Coverage: </b>Light<br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Liquid<br><br><B>SPF: </B>Over 30<b><br><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Zinc Oxide 15%: Mineral broad-spectrum SPF 35 protection.<br>- Hyaluronic Acid: Hydrates and visibly plumps skin.<br>- Licorice Root: Visibly brightens skin.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> An award-winning sheer tint in 14 flexible shades gives a dewy, no-makeup glow. Its lightweight, flexible formula blends seamlessly into a wide range of skin tones and delivers a natural-dewy finish with sheer-light cov</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply one to two pumps (no shaking required) to clean, moisturized skin using The Big Brush (sold separately) or fingertips. <br>-For best results, allow skincare to fully absorb before applying. Slip Tint&trade; is a nourishing, skincare-infused formula, so a little goes a long way. <br>-Blend evenly and build only where needed for a natural, skin-like finish. <br>-Saie tip: Apply Glowy Super&trade; Gel (sold separately) before or after for major glow.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Zinc Oxide (15%), Water, Coco-caprylate/caprate, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, C15-19 Alkane, Isocetyl Stearoyl Stearate, Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Jojoba Esters, Tribehenin, Beeswax, Glyceryl Stearate, Leuconostoc/radish Root Ferment Filtrate, Glycerin, Lactobacillus, Acacia Senegal Gum, Xanthan Gum, Viola Tricolor Extract, Bisabolol, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Fruit Extract. May Contain: Titanium Dioxide, Iron Oxides, Mica.<br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i><br><br><i><b>Product Disclosures:</b> For external use only. Do not use on damaged or broken skin. When using this product, keep out of eyes. If contact with eyes occurs, rinse with water to remove. Stop use and ask a doctor if rash occurs. Keep out of reach of children. If product is swallowed, get medical help or contact Poison Control Center right away.      </i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Zinc SPF</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ allure 2021 Best of Beauty Award Winner</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A noncomedogenic, dewy tinted moisturizer for all skin types with 15 percent mineral zinc, SPF 35, hyaluronic acid, and light coverage.<br><br><b>Coverage: </b>Light<br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Liquid<br><br><B>SPF: </B>Over 30<b><br><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Zinc Oxide 15%: Mineral broad-spectrum SPF 35 protection.<br>- Hyaluronic Acid: Hydrates and visibly plumps skin.<br>- Licorice Root: Visibly brightens skin.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> An award-winning sheer tint in 14 flexible shades gives a dewy, no-makeup glow. Its lightweight, flexible formula blends seamlessly into a wide range of skin tones and delivers a natural-dewy finish with sheer-light cov</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply one to two pumps (no shaking required) to clean, moisturized skin using The Big Brush (sold separately) or fingertips. <br>-For best results, allow skincare to fully absorb before applying. Slip Tint&trade; is a nourishing, skincare-infused formula, so a little goes a long way. <br>-Blend evenly and build only where needed for a natural, skin-like finish. <br>-Saie tip: Apply Glowy Super&trade; Gel (sold separately) before or after for major glow.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Zinc Oxide (15%), Water, Coco-caprylate/caprate, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, C15-19 Alkane, Isocetyl Stearoyl Stearate, Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Jojoba Esters, Tribehenin, Beeswax, Glyceryl Stearate, Leuconostoc/radish Root Ferment Filtrate, Glycerin, Lactobacillus, Acacia Senegal Gum, Xanthan Gum, Viola Tricolor Extract, Bisabolol, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Fruit Extract. May Contain: Titanium Dioxide, Iron Oxides, Mica.<br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i><br><br><i><b>Product Disclosures:</b> For external use only. Do not use on damaged or broken skin. When using this product, keep out of eyes. If contact with eyes occurs, rinse with water to remove. Stop use and ask a doctor if rash occurs. Keep out of reach of children. If product is swallowed, get medical help or contact Poison Control Center right away.      </i></div></details>",
